- Banked answer (m008_openrouter3.md): incomplete — said it could not resolve offline, left all OWED items open [not verified]
- Hermes receipt (m008_hermes.md): correct conclusion but claims DOI 0149 resolves to Bricault/Delgalvis — that specific link is unverified by my fetch (404) [partially verified]
- My fetches (DBLP TOC + IEEE Xplore + DOI resolver): fully resolve the core claim [verified]

**Remaining OWED:** the verbatim-quote source across lanes was never identified in any receipt — the ask said "this unblocks the verbatim-quote OWED" but no specific quote was given to trace.

